instance?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9cqauad3e","line":12},{"title":"11\\. I am in Early Release Program, but I am not on the latest version yet. Can I directly upgrade to Xanadu?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9cqauad3f","line":13},{"title":"12\\. How would I know that I am signed up for Early Availability?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9cqauad3g","line":14},{"title":"13\\. How is Early Release Program rolled out?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9cqauad3h","line":15},{"title":"14\\. I am a participant and want to report an issue on the new release - what should I do?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9cqauad3i","line":16},{"title":"15\\. I have been on Early Release for past versions. Do I have to request to participate in every release?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9cqauad3j","line":17},{"title":"16\\. If I am interested in one of the paid features of the new release, how would that work in Early Availability?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9cqauad3k","line":18},{"title":"17\\. If Early Release Program participants get the release 1-8 weeks early, when do other customers receive the release?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9cqauad3l","line":19},{"title":"18\\. I'm registered for the Early Release Program but unable to update an existing upgrade change?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9cqauad3m","line":20},{"title":"19\\. I still have questions related to the Early Release Program that are not covered in this FAQ - whom should I contact?","target":"#mcetoc_1f9cqauad3n","line":21}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
